{"overview":"پس از مرگ ناگهانی و پیش از موعد پدرش که او را به دنیای بی‌رحم دبیرستان عمومی می‌کشاند، کاری مجبور می‌شود با رسوایی سرکوبی ویروسی که جامعه‌اش را در هم می‌شکند، فشارهای بی‌وقفه و بی‌رحمی‌های روزمره عصر شبکه‌های اجتماعی، و بیداری نیروهای تلکینزی مرموزی که همزمان با بلوغش ظاهر می‌شوند، مقابله کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After her father's sudden, untimely death thrusts her into the unforgiving ecosystem of public high school, Carrie is forced to navigate a viral bullying scandal that tears through her community, the relentless pressure and casual cruelty of the social‑media age, and the awakening of mysterious telekinetic powers that rise alongside her adolescence.","tagline_en":"She just wanted a friend. They gave her a fight.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/b7aKxwPj3QM8YHZ8uDyqr50i96D.jpg"}],"episodes":8,"crew":["Mike Flanagan"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","CA"],"cast":[{"name":"Summer H. Howell","role":"Carrie White","photo":"/9l9D6DhugB4FBIZecuMyZ4Uulyr.jpg"},{"name":"سامانتا اسلوین","role":"Margaret White","photo":"/iI6mYgxrQSwphBJdfwYN3vB6oS2.jpg","en":"Samantha Sloyan"},{"name":"سینا آگودونگ","role":"Sue Snell","photo":"/nCVWiVrIVqw0LnpyhYsckOMQJHS.jpg","en":"Siena Agudong"},{"name":"Alison Thornton","role":"Chris Hargensen","photo":"/hDCMe5RLABbSBA04BIUxJnBmol6.jpg"},{"name":"Joel Oulette","role":"Tommy Ross","photo":"/qmzQBjq1hLpU37HtsKw5MszgRKa.jpg"},{"name":"Josie Totah","role":"Tina Blake","photo":"/125iM9BTPVDfRjKGVSqmvgeGsai.jpg"},{"name":"Arthur Conti","role":"Billy Nolan","photo":"/pnO8qBwvLJfN54UaKsy0QQlAc8u.jpg"},{"name":"Thalia Dudek","role":"Emaline West","photo":"/lmpaF8Yi0SfojtEwlY1CkEjzGU7.jpg"},{"name":"Amber Midthunder","role":"Miss Desjardin","photo":"/f8VWGyaIS38NkDIzQ2hapXKt0N5.jpg"},{"name":"متیو لیلارد","role":"Principal Grayle","photo":"/mIEKAfe0iC41RDXibbTy48LtNOi.jpg","en":"Matthew Lillard"},{"name":"Rahul Kohli","role":"Harold Allison","photo":"/9wTBpyPhy